os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/d341ad8b8ece128407c99e1ceb815883b5cfd23a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:31:27Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:31:27Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"message":"Phase E: docs consolidation for the AI hint/explain feature\n\nWraps up Phases A-D with a single real-numbers summary table in the\nbuild log and finishes the architecture doc''s module map (adds the\nPhase C eval harness alongside the hint/explain pipelines already\nadded incrementally). No new findings - every gap (hint-session reset,\nguardrail heuristic limits, the actual 20% post-fix leak rate, no live\nfrontend click-through) was already disclosed in\ndocs/ai-code-review-known-limitations.md as it was found in Phases\nA-D; this phase makes sure it''s all in one findable pass rather than\nscattered across four commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d742cf235c3e961293900e59e5a2fccb3bf23db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/0d742cf235c3e961293900e59e5a2fccb3bf23db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/d341ad8b8ece128407c99e1ceb815883b5cfd23a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90844573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/events{/privacy}","followers