:90844573,"login":"NIkhilSaravade","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODQ0NTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/5a03224a2e75fa3489748d39b6a35d6eda092e2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:30:49Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T10:30:49Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"message":"Phase D: wire hints/explain into the editor\n\nAdds frontend/src/api/aiHints.ts and two new SolvePage.tsx tabs:\nHints (graduated hint history + a two-step, structurally separate\nsolution-reveal confirmation) and Explain (post-solve walkthrough,\ndefaulting to the latest PASSED submission when one exists).\n\nVerified via tsc --noEmit, oxlint, npm run build, and a dev-server\nboot check - no live click-through against a running backend this\nsession (no docker-compose stack up), disclosed in\ndocs/ai-code-review-known-limitations.md item 10, same constraint\nalready logged for the Phase 6 frontend work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f73dd06b33d09efb5d47a2921103068a7547079f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/f73dd06b33d09efb5d47a2921103068a7547079f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/5a03224a2e75fa3489748d39b6a35d6eda092e2d","verificat