pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/8e55c6bc69561613489c42c1b7238f7acce2897f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:39:37Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:39:37Z","email":"90844573+NIkhilSaravade@users.noreply.github.com","name":"NIkhilSaravade"},"message":"Frontend: consume the upgraded ai-analysis-service (SSE, 429s, trust signals)\n\nThe frontend had not been touched across all 6 phases - it only polled\nGET /ai/analysis/{id} for a static PENDING/READY result.\n\nBackend (found by the requested type audit, not just assumed): GET\n/ai/analysis/{id} and POST /ai/analyze''s cache-hit path never returned\ntoolCalls/criticVerdict/revised at all - AnalysisCache only ever persisted\nthe raw LLM text. Added AnalysisCache.metadata_json (db/models.py), wired\nthrough analysis_pipeline.py''s read/write paths and both main.py response\nsites. New tests: test_analysis_pipeline_metadata.py (real SQLite\nround-trip proving the data survives write-then-read, not a mock) and\ntest_main_analysis_metadata.py (endpoint-level). 58 passed, clean\nruff/bandit.\n\nFrontend: api/client.ts now throws ApiError (an Error subclass carrying\nthe HTTP status - every existing `err instanceof Error` catch site keeps\nworking unchanged), which is what makes the new 429 handling possible.\napi/submissions.ts adds streamAiAnalysis (hand-rolled SSE parsing over\nfetch()/ReadableStream - EventSource can''t POST a body/Bearer token) and\nisRateLimitError. SolvePage.tsx''s Run/Submit flow now streams a live\nreview instead of polling, showing the raw JSON build up token-by-token,\nbadges for which tools fed the review, \"Referenced: ...\" RAG citation\nchips, and a verified/not-yet-verified badge driven by\ncriticVerdict === null (unambiguous - the critic never returns null for\nsomething it actually checked, even a plain approval) - honestly showing\n\"not yet verified\" on every streamed review, since the critic pass still\nonly runs on the non-streaming path (Phase 5''s disclosed limitation).\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit clean, oxlint clean, npm run build succeeds, dev\nserver boots and serves. NOT verified: click-through against the live\nbackend in a browser - Docker Desktop wasn''t running in this environment\nand standing up the full stack was out of scope for this pass. Disclosed\nin docs/ai-code-review-known-limitations.md''s updated item #6, not\nsilently skipped.","tree":{"sha":"50694716f497d52bc0178ee40021b66fb8a8a97d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/50694716f497d52bc0178ee40021b66fb8a8a97d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/8e55c6bc69561613489c42c1b7238f7acce2897f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90844573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade","id":90844573,"login":"NIkhilSaravade","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODQ0NTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/received_events","re