nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"16ef20f1e938607aaf8a9abeef6ab819f3437184","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/16ef20f1e938607aaf8a9abeef6ab819f3437184"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/5d6d3d94b717a92979acaf518915b68e3e1f63a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 16ef20f1e938607aaf8a9abeef6ab819f3437184\nparent b538b9563f81e24f1f80311de9a8d3473760f852\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788724192 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788724192 +0000\n\nAdd comprehensive project documentation covering architecture through incident postmortems\n\n15 in-depth documents in docs/, sourced from the full 140-commit git\nhistory plus this session''s complete debugging record: architecture\noverview, the Docker-to-Kubernetes migration, the sandbox execution\nengine, language/harness support for all 7 languages, security\nhardening, CI/CD (including the multi-arch build bugs and the\nremaining CD gap), the full resource-tuning saga, auth/session\nmanagement, observability, data/storage/messaging, networking and\ningress, the AI analysis service''s evolution, formal incident\npostmortems for every hard bug this project hit, an operations\nrunbook, and a portfolio/interview-notes capstone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMsbQ8kV\nHkwuKvcs5Lt7FHpYx4hIThYT5z2Nkp80bCh3suecxkMz9JaYjT+JwIUoss9BZwsTd+5dzYtBLQrq\nVAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T19:50:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github