f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b","sha":"c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b"}],"sha":"8090de03b091af0e11369aedf492b450dc5d32ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/8090de03b091af0e11369aedf492b450dc5d32ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:22:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:22:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Disable GOPROXY/GOSUMDB in the Go sandbox to stop doomed network calls\n\nLive-reproduced inside a running sandbox-go pod: `go build` on a\ndependency-free, stdlib-only file took 34.68s (vs 0.61s with these\nvars set) because Go''s toolchain defaults to GOPROXY=proxy.golang.org\nand GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org, and tries to reach them even though\nnothing here ever has external dependencies to fetch.\n\nThe sandbox-execution namespace has a default-deny NetworkPolicy\n(infra/k8s/01-networkpolicy.yaml, enforced now that Calico replaced\nFlannel) blocking all ingress/egress, including DNS - by design, since\nthis is untrusted user code and must not be able to reach the network\nat all. Every Go build was burning 20-30s on doomed DNS lookups\n(compounded by Kubernetes'' DNS search-domain suffixes) before falling\nthrough to actually compiling, routinely exceeding the compile step''s\n~15s timeout and getting killed before printing anything - the\nempty-output CE users kept hitting.\n\nFix is GOPROXY=off/GOSUMDB=off, not loosening the NetworkPolicy: the\nsandbox stays fully locked down, Go just stops expecting network\naccess it was never entitled to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"3c13b466b40620790d4c8453f6b574234142afe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/3c13b466b40620790d4c8453f6b574234142afe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c13b466b40620790d4c8453f6b574234142afe3\nparent b0affc71686ae39c271b73a4ffa58e64983952e3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788715360 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788715360 +0000\n\nDisable GOPROXY/GOSUMDB in the Go sandbox to stop doomed network calls\n\nLive-reproduced inside a running sandbox-go pod: `go build` on a\ndependency-free, stdlib-only file took 34.68s (vs 0.61s with these\nvars set) because Go''s toolchain defaults to GOPROXY=proxy.golang.org\nand GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org, and tries to reach them even though\nnothing here ever has external dependencies to fetch.\n\nThe sandbox-execution namespace has a default-deny NetworkPolicy\n(infra/k8s/01-networkpolicy.yaml, enforced now that Calico replaced\nFlannel) blocking all ingress/egress, including DNS - by design, since\nthis is untrusted user code and must not be able to reach the network\nat all. Every Go build was burning 20-30s on doomed DNS lookups\n(compounded by Kubernetes'' DNS search-domain suffixes) before falling\nthrough to actually compiling, routinely exceeding the compile step''s\n~15s timeout and getting killed before printing anything - the\nempty-output CE users kept hitting.\n\nFix is GOPROXY=off/GOSUMDB=off, not loosening the NetworkPolicy: the\nsandbox stays fully locked down, Go just stops expecting network\naccess it was never entitled to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIwpdoTV\n7XrErfpAcW8mg923zLtQj7dVNlVrY14Bu9piM6iyz5dyRztEUwjv06mViGQ3EfULC0elxjRAQpjv\n4gE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T17:22:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKGM0YjlkMzM4OTgzZjM0MzJhYjdkOThjZDQ2MGE4N2JlMzhiNzc2M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/b0affc71686ae39c271b73a4ffa58e64983952e3","sha":"b0affc71686ae39c271b73a4ffa58e64983952e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/b0affc71686ae39c271b73a4ffa58e64983952e3"}],"sha":"c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c4b9d338983f3432ab7d98cd460a87be38b7763b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90844573?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade","id":90844573,"login":"NIkhilSaravade","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODQ0NTcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NIkhilSaravade","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/766a701302f00ad74405478615be8b51a8478327/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026