346ecba029f872040fc9c40d1983f2466b0b03","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKDAzMzQ2ZWNiYTAyOWY4NzIwNDBmYzljNDBkMTk4M2YyNDY2YjBiMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90","sha":"97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/c1a864ca0c3df766c7fed981840b86b29fb5b92a","sha":"c1a864ca0c3df766c7fed981840b86b29fb5b92a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c1a864ca0c3df766c7fed981840b86b29fb5b92a"}],"sha":"03346ecba029f872040fc9c40d1983f2466b0b03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/03346ecba029f872040fc9c40d1983f2466b0b03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c1a864ca0c3df766c7fed981840b86b29fb5b92a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:58:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:58:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fold verdict status into ai-analysis-service''s cache key\n\nThe analysis cache was keyed purely by sha256(problem_id + normalized\ncode), with no verdict in the key. Resubmitting the exact same code\nafter it starts passing (e.g. after fixing an unrelated platform bug)\nhashed to the same cache_key as an earlier CE/FAILED run of that same\ncode, so run_analysis() served back the old FAILED-shaped analysis\n(failureReason/debuggingSuggestion/edgeCases/hints) instead of ever\ncalling the LLM again for the new PASSED verdict - the model output\nlooked like a confident but wrong compile-error narrative for code\nthat had actually just passed.\n\nstatus is now part of the hashed key, so a FAILED-verdict analysis and\na PASSED-verdict analysis for identical code always land in separate\ncache rows and can never shadow each other.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"9d4a676342bf3311ad683afbce7720ca69319761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/9d4a676342bf3311ad683afbce7720ca69319761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/c1a864ca0c3df766c7fed981840b86b29fb5b92a","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d4a676342bf3311ad683afbce7720ca69319761\nparent 97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788688706 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788688706 +0000\n\nFold verdict status into ai-analysis-service''s cache key\n\nThe analysis cache was keyed purely by sha256(problem_id + normalized\ncode), with no verdict in the key. Resubmitting the exact same code\nafter it starts passing (e.g. after fixing an unrelated platform bug)\nhashed to the same cache_key as an earlier CE/FAILED run of that same\ncode, so run_analysis() served back the old FAILED-shaped analysis\n(failureReason/debuggingSuggestion/edgeCases/hints) instead of ever\ncalling the LLM again for the new PASSED verdict - the model output\nlooked like a confident but wrong compile-error narrative for code\nthat had actually just passed.\n\nstatus is now part of the hashed key, so a FAILED-verdict analysis and\na PASSED-verdict analysis for identical code always land in separate\ncache rows and can never shadow each other.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP4FlUFK\nORTWlbnbstq5wsS3INGLsyFOn7hupUU60DgDoNjGEwoaj7MdCUxsDS946luQ//IOBn6nJCIXlquW\nkAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T09:58:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":