:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKDk3ZDRjNzU3NTQ4N2UyNGZiZDE2YTUzNWVmMTcxOTAwYWFiOTVjOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/39ad7a40735dc22f5b8fed36273c9e4235d711ad","sha":"39ad7a40735dc22f5b8fed36273c9e4235d711ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/39ad7a40735dc22f5b8fed36273c9e4235d711ad"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/8bb9007bc6307f2deeefd230aed852a8c6230352","sha":"8bb9007bc6307f2deeefd230aed852a8c6230352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/8bb9007bc6307f2deeefd230aed852a8c6230352"}],"sha":"97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/97d4c7575487e24fbd16a535ef171900aab95c90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/8bb9007bc6307f2deeefd230aed852a8c6230352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:31:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:31:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Register ai-analysis-service with Eureka using its IP, not pod hostname\n\napi-gateway was consistently 500ing on /ai/analysis/{id} with\nUnknownHostException: Failed to resolve ''ai-analysis-service-<old-pod>'' -\nevery restart left api-gateway''s client-side load balancer trying to\nDNS-resolve the previous pod''s raw Kubernetes hostname, which isn''t a\nresolvable name in-cluster.\n\npy_eureka_client.init_async() takes instance_ip and instance_host as\nseparate parameters; only instance_ip was set, so instance_host (which\nbecomes the registered Eureka \"hostName\" field - what other services''\nload balancers actually build request URLs from) defaulted to\nsocket.gethostname(), i.e. the pod''s own hostname. The Java services\navoid this exact problem via EUREKA_INSTANCE_PREFER_IP_ADDRESS=true;\nsetting instance_host to the same resolved IP as instance_ip here is\nthis client''s equivalent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"7128d8fe5de8e408812f07f6f9d74eb6ffffc8a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/7128d8fe5de8e408812f07f6f9d74eb6ffffc8a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/8bb9007bc6307f2deeefd230aed852a8c6230352","verification":{"payload":"tree 7128d8fe5de8e408812f07f6f9d74eb6ffffc8a3\nparent 39ad7a40735dc22f5b8fed36273c9e4235d711ad\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788683479 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788683479 +0000\n\nRegister ai-analysis-service with Eureka using its IP, not pod hostname\n\napi-gateway was consistently 500ing on /ai/analysis/{id} with\nUnknownHostException: Failed to resolve ''ai-analysis-service-<old-pod>'' -\nevery restart left api-gateway''s client-side load balancer trying to\nDNS-resolve the previous pod''s raw Kubernetes hostname, which isn''t a\nresolvable name in-cluster.\n\npy_eureka_client.init_async() takes instance_ip and instance_host as\nseparate parameters; only instance_ip was set, so instance_host (which\nbecomes the registered Eureka \"hostName\" field - what other services''\nload balancers actually build request URLs from) defaulted to\nsocket.gethostname(), i.e. the pod''s own hostname. The Java services\navoid this exact problem via EUREKA_INSTANCE_PREFER_IP_ADDRESS=true;\nsetting instance_host to the same resolved IP as instance_ip here is\nthis client''s equivalent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAA