","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/0c64c77057dc13b3410ada106dfbc95ee0839220/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T21:15:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T21:15:23Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Make api-gateway''s CORS allowed origins configurable, allow prod domains\n\nSecurityConfig hardcoded allowedOriginPatterns to http://localhost:*\n(dev only) - the deployed frontend at app.nikhilsaravade.com got\n\"Failed to fetch\" on every request, since the browser''s CORS preflight\nwas rejected before the request ever reached this service.\n\nExternalized to cors.allowed-origin-patterns (comma-separated), same\npattern as this project''s other cross-environment config - local dev\nkeeps the existing default via application.properties, and\n09-api-gateway.yaml overrides it via CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN_PATTERNS to\nalso allow the real frontend origins (app.nikhilsaravade.com, future\n*.nikhilsaravade.com subdomains for UAT, and the pages.dev fallback\ndomain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"ab5e3fc0f440805f2d464affbfab284b3deb715e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/ab5e3fc0f440805f2d464affbfab284b3deb715e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/0c64c77057dc13b3410ada106dfbc95ee0839220","verification":{"payload":"tree ab5e3fc0f440805f2d464affbfab284b3deb715e\nparent d080d63983e9e26f5cac9438f3d1b30a5f153327\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788642922 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788642923 +0000\n\nMake api-gateway''s CORS allowed origins configurable, allow prod domains\n\nSecurityConfig hardcoded allowedOriginPatterns to http://localhost:*\n(dev only) - the deployed frontend at app.nikhilsaravade.com got\n\"Failed to fetch\" on every request, since the browser''s CORS preflight\nwas rejected before the request ever reached this service.\n\nExternalized to cors.allowed-origin-patterns (comma-separated), same\npattern as this project''s other cross-environment config - local dev\nkeeps the existing default via application.properties, and\n09-api-gateway.yaml overrides it via CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGIN_PATTERNS to\nalso allow the real frontend origins (app.nikhilsaravade.com, future\n*.nikhilsaravade.com subdomains for UAT, and the pages.dev fallback\ndomain).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCt+gFVj\n6lD1iqicJWRjvUh/37gyfVFwvtyHNEXRpY5Ttj37ABuwV3JQAQBuiYoq3CBA36pVo0LnKuVbnArz\nOgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T21:15:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gis