rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/0cae07e44876a68ecce9d6630b1f8bf717618835/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:36:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:36:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Raise ai-analysis-service''s memory limit: 512Mi wasn''t enough\n\nOOMKilled (exit 137) on the prod VM, repeatedly, a few seconds after\nstartup - it loads a HuggingFace sentence-transformers embeddings\nmodel via RAGService, and PyTorch plus the model weights alone routinely\nneed more than 512Mi, on top of FastAPI/uvicorn''s own baseline.\n\nThe node has 24GB total with only ~4.2GB requested across everything\nelse, so there''s plenty of headroom to raise this without touching any\nother service''s budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"6c2f5470ac5ba163aaa4b35432761ab7b23cd116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/6c2f5470ac5ba163aaa4b35432761ab7b23cd116"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/0cae07e44876a68ecce9d6630b1f8bf717618835","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c2f5470ac5ba163aaa4b35432761ab7b23cd116\nparent a734e5b4d0d1460fdd745aeabf63e3a5cecfbfe8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788640590 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788640594 +0000\n\nRaise ai-analysis-service''s memory limit: 512Mi wasn''t enough\n\nOOMKilled (exit 137) on the prod VM, repeatedly, a few seconds after\nstartup - it loads a HuggingFace sentence-transformers embeddings\nmodel via RAGService, and PyTorch plus the model weights alone routinely\nneed more than 512Mi, on top of FastAPI/uvicorn''s own baseline.\n\nThe node has 24GB total with only ~4.2GB requested across everything\nelse, so there''s plenty of headroom to raise this without touching any\nother service''s budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNtvuGHW\nrverHlNPeg9EUHt4TXtWsv5umW9fS5QeUepiEvb09+Yafmq7i9G6fCzuitN2SPcwwYUSWXMkPKwK\npgg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T20:36:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/0cae07e44876a68ecce9d6630b1f8bf717618835","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKDBjYWUwN2U0NDg3NmE2OGVjY2U5ZDY2MzBiMWY4YmY3MTc2MTg4MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/a734e5b