s://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/a734e5b4d0d1460fdd745aeabf63e3a5cecfbfe8","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKGE3MzRlNWI0ZDBkMTQ2MGZkZDc0NWFlYWJmNjNlM2E1Y2VjZmJmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7","sha":"c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/b76a726b9b4a522730bfc7fec37dca09b7a14028","sha":"b76a726b9b4a522730bfc7fec37dca09b7a14028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/b76a726b9b4a522730bfc7fec37dca09b7a14028"}],"sha":"a734e5b4d0d1460fdd745aeabf63e3a5cecfbfe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/a734e5b4d0d1460fdd745aeabf63e3a5cecfbfe8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/b76a726b9b4a522730bfc7fec37dca09b7a14028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:16:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:16:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Load auth-service''s JWT private key from a Secret, not the classpath\n\njwt-private.pem was never committed (correctly - it''s a private key),\nso it was never baked into the Docker image either, unlike the public\nkey that already lives at\nauth-service/src/main/resources/keys/jwt-public.pem. auth-service\ncrash-looped in prod with \"class path resource [keys/jwt-private.pem]\ncannot be opened because it does not exist\" the moment it needed to\nactually sign a token.\n\nJwtKeyConfig previously hardcoded ClassPathResource, which can only\never read out of the jar. Switched to Spring''s DefaultResourceLoader,\nwhich resolves an unprefixed path against the classpath exactly as\nbefore (no change for local/dev config) but also honors an explicit\n\"file:\" prefix - so 07-auth-service.yaml can override\njwt.private-key-path via JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH to point at a private\nkey mounted from a new auth-service-jwt-key Secret instead, the same\npattern every other per-service secret in this project already uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"88babd9e25d21818d4bcc2ce909ad5509f3dd273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/88babd9e25d21818d4bcc2ce909ad5509f3dd273"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/b76a726b9b4a522730bfc7fec37dca09b7a14028","verification":{"payload":"tree 88babd9e25d21818d4bcc2ce909ad5509f3dd273\nparent c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788639397 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788639398 +0000\n\nLoad auth-service''s JWT private key from a Secret, not the classpath\n\njwt-private.pem was never committed (correctly - it''s a private key),\nso it was never baked into the Docker image either, unlike the public\nkey that already lives at\nauth-service/src/main/resources/keys/jwt-public.pem. auth-service\ncrash-looped in prod with \"class path resource [keys/jwt-private.pem]\ncannot be opened because it does not exist\" the moment it needed to\nactually sign a token.\n\nJwtKeyConfig previously hardcoded ClassPathResource, which can only\never read out of the jar. Switched to Spring''s DefaultResourceLoader,\nwhich resolves an unprefixed path against the classpath exactly as\nbefore (no change for local/dev config) but also honors an explicit\n\"file:\" prefix - so 07-auth-service.yaml can override\njwt.private-key-path via JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH to point at a private\nkey mounted from a new auth-service-jwt-key Secret instead, the same\npattern every other per-service secret in this project already uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE3xgLul\n226fNCfX