s://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKGM3MjBlYTg0MWY4NmIwZGM4NGVkZThjYjc3Yzg4YTZkODZmYTI3ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/e83156962ba6183a6436e62cad407817cfb00bd6","sha":"e83156962ba6183a6436e62cad407817cfb00bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/e83156962ba6183a6436e62cad407817cfb00bd6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/641170b20fac9e73eb903e5a338d32cac7cf22da","sha":"641170b20fac9e73eb903e5a338d32cac7cf22da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/641170b20fac9e73eb903e5a338d32cac7cf22da"}],"sha":"c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/c720ea841f86b0dc84ede8cb77c88a6d86fa27e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/641170b20fac9e73eb903e5a338d32cac7cf22da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:06:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T20:06:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Lower app service CPU requests to fit the VM''s actual 4-vCPU budget\n\nAll 9 app service Deployments together requested up to 1150m CPU on a\nnode with only 4000m allocatable, and combined with worker-service-go,\nthe sandbox seccomp DaemonSet, and k3s/Calico''s own system pods, total\nrequested CPU hit 3900m (97%) - confirmed on the prod VM, where 3 of\nthe 9 services (auth, problem, ai-analysis) sat Pending indefinitely\nwith \"Insufficient cpu\", even though actual node CPU usage was ~12%.\n\nKubernetes schedules against requests, not real usage, so the fix is\nto request less, not to add capacity: halved requests across all 9\nmanifests (100m->50m, 150m->75m) while leaving CPU limits untouched,\nso each service can still burst to its existing ceiling under load -\nonly the scheduling-time reservation shrinks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"40a43f0825537738b04f4b66f9beb9680492042f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/40a43f0825537738b04f4b66f9beb9680492042f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/641170b20fac9e73eb903e5a338d32cac7cf22da","verification":{"payload":"tree 40a43f0825537738b04f4b66f9beb9680492042f\nparent e83156962ba6183a6436e62cad407817cfb00bd6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788638790 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788638791 +0000\n\nLower app service CPU requests to fit the VM''s actual 4-vCPU budget\n\nAll 9 app service Deployments together requested up to 1150m CPU on a\nnode with only 4000m allocatable, and combined with worker-service-go,\nthe sandbox seccomp DaemonSet, and k3s/Calico''s own system pods, total\nrequested CPU hit 3900m (97%) - confirmed on the prod VM, where 3 of\nthe 9 services (auth, problem, ai-analysis) sat Pending indefinitely\nwith \"Insufficient cpu\", even though actual node CPU usage was ~12%.\n\nKubernetes schedules against requests, not real usage, so the fix is\nto request less, not to add capacity: halved requests across all 9\nmanifests (100m->50m, 150m->75m) while leaving CPU limits untouched,\nso each service can still burst to its existing ceiling under load -\nonly the scheduling-time reservation shrinks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQB3en4TD\ncNlZ4poMKhyqisRhU8SEFGNoSOiQXEzkEcsf6xZqdLpXYR6b0aH1HVQ3NgrVY56wvImgMFk0+K/y\nLws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T20:06:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl