rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/d04d410ee83f909a4ed93f546baa8dcdd9c0803d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:37:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T17:37:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix all 9 Java services'' Dockerfiles: alpine JRE image is amd64-only\n\neclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine has no arm64 build on Docker Hub, which\nsilently broke every one of these builds the first time CI actually tried\nto build for arm64 (the target k3s VM''s architecture) - confirmed via\nDocker Hub''s tag manifest for that image.\n\nSwitched the runtime stage to eclipse-temurin:17-jre-jammy (Ubuntu-based,\nconfirmed multi-arch including linux/arm64/v8). This also means the\nnon-root user setup needs Debian''s groupadd/useradd instead of Alpine''s\naddgroup/adduser - busybox''s syntax doesn''t exist on this base image.\n\nThe builder stage (maven:3.9.9-eclipse-temurin-17) was already multi-arch\nand didn''t need to change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"b911ccaa6ff0cdeed51131ff8c314aecaa5cf735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/b911ccaa6ff0cdeed51131ff8c314aecaa5cf735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/d04d410ee83f909a4ed93f546baa8dcdd9c0803d","verification":{"payload":"tree b911ccaa6ff0cdeed51131ff8c314aecaa5cf735\nparent a803ee73f35115602098f31d87e9f5958c266de3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788629835 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788629835 +0000\n\nFix all 9 Java services'' Dockerfiles: alpine JRE image is amd64-only\n\neclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine has no arm64 build on Docker Hub, which\nsilently broke every one of these builds the first time CI actually tried\nto build for arm64 (the target k3s VM''s architecture) - confirmed via\nDocker Hub''s tag manifest for that image.\n\nSwitched the runtime stage to eclipse-temurin:17-jre-jammy (Ubuntu-based,\nconfirmed multi-arch including linux/arm64/v8). This also means the\nnon-root user setup needs Debian''s groupadd/useradd instead of Alpine''s\naddgroup/adduser - busybox''s syntax doesn''t exist on this base image.\n\nThe builder stage (maven:3.9.9-eclipse-temurin-17) was already multi-arch\nand didn''t need to change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBUzyJzx\nvUD1E7h4CQlZ4lFCULgV02uG1GFRie8Nhg4BATRyNrqxqbqT+WiNPonOUHO4B4EHS92P2QdO/gpV\nvQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T17:37:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":