ePullSecrets reference, which would have failed every\npod with ImagePullBackOff on first apply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW","tree":{"sha":"84b988d8f1c48efaaa654847fdd90a6c16eaf402","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/84b988d8f1c48efaaa654847fdd90a6c16eaf402"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/a715b382e2016ef672e0d9a4e7e6261a6e32b742","verification":{"payload":"tree 84b988d8f1c48efaaa654847fdd90a6c16eaf402\nparent 311aeda82942e32ea1fdf56841f8215a0efb439a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788628263 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788628263 +0000\n\nFix: add missing imagePullSecrets to the 9 new service manifests\n\nghcr.io packages are private by default (same issue already handled for\nworker-service-go in 04-worker-deployment.yaml) - these 9 manifests were\nmissing the same imagePullSecrets reference, which would have failed every\npod with ImagePullBackOff on first apply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0149o5QZBdtHxkX8gdsNfEwW\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFf8EIQx\nvPc0eHbP6EJ8vN8H6Vs6OznE1hmDs0kpFXXbWnaGR/RHNbB/D2WIos5Qwn9QW7F4UYUp93NRvCTH\n6gA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T17:11:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gra