,{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/5e5153d4b85547ec73ceb6b0c795fd8cb3b996b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:50:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:50:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix CI: grant pull-requests:read so the changes job can diff PRs\n\nThe changes job''s dorny/paths-filter step failed on the pull_request\ntrigger with \"Resource not accessible by integration\" - on PR events it\nasks the GitHub API which files changed (unlike push, where it just diffs\nlocally), and that call needs pull-requests: read on the job''s token. Only\nthe build job had explicit permissions, so changes ran with the repo''s\ndefault token permissions, which didn''t include it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y43hZPHGj7PwdjuQS9fp31","tree":{"sha":"92d9079206c4fa6fd3a76dbd457e05e04abcd067","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/92d9079206c4fa6fd3a76dbd457e05e04abcd067"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/5e5153d4b85547ec73ceb6b0c795fd8cb3b996b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 92d9079206c4fa6fd3a76dbd457e05e04abcd067\nparent b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788616240 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788616240 +0000\n\nFix CI: grant pull-requests:read so the changes job can diff PRs\n\nThe changes job''s dorny/paths-filter step failed on the pull_request\ntrigger with \"Resource not accessible by integration\" - on PR events it\nasks the GitHub API which files changed (unlike push, where it just diffs\nlocally), and that call needs pull-requests: read on the job''s token. Only\nthe build job had explicit permissions, so changes ran with the repo''s\ndefault token permissions, which didn''t include it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y43hZPHGj7PwdjuQS9fp31\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFwAccZ+\nfePj7hwR2fLlnAkkqJbjvC9M+5UL01HB1a/QKYNCpwzRRFiuJYAg4HyeKeJkg7nC0gWWWWQsj8wG\nWwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T13:50:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/5e5153d4b85547ec73ceb6b0c795fd8cb3b996b1","node_id":"C_kwDORTK7XtoAKDVlNTE1M2Q0Yjg1NTQ3ZWM3M2NlYjZiMGM3OTVmZDhjYjNiOTk2YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commit/b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2","sha":"b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2"}],"sha":"5e5153d4b85547ec73ceb6b0c795fd8cb3b996b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/5e5153d4b85547ec73ceb6b0c795fd8cb3b996b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/commits/b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:47:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:47:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add GitHub Actions CI to build and push images to ghcr.io\n\nAdds .github/workflows/docker-build-push.yml, which builds each service''s\nDockerfile and pushes it to ghcr.io, building only the services whose\ndirectory changed (via dorny/paths-filter), with a workflow_dispatch/tag\noverride to force a full rebuild. Images target linux/arm64 to match the\nactual k3s VM, not linux/amd64.\n\nAlso fixes worker-service-go/Dockerfile, which hardcoded GOARCH=amd64 -\nharmless under the old Docker Compose flow but silently wrong for\nKubernetes: a multi-arch build for the arm64 cluster node would have kept\nproducing an amd64 binary that can''t run there. Now cross-compiles via\nbuildx''s TARGETOS/TARGETARCH build args.\n\nPoints 04-worker-deployment.yaml at the new ghcr.io image and documents\nthe ghcr pull-secret setup and the (optional) switch from manually\n`docker save`-ing the node-typescript sandbox image into containerd to\njust pulling it from ghcr.io like everything else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y43hZPHGj7PwdjuQS9fp31","tree":{"sha":"bb048f7f0924f859a4e98f6496dffc779f8cdd8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/trees/bb048f7f0924f859a4e98f6496dffc779f8cdd8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NIkhilSaravade/MS-code-execution-platform/git/commits/b3f1fa4486cf3bb73b654cad854ab1b6796ad1e2","verification":{"payload":"tree bb048f7f0924f859a4e98f6496dffc779f8cdd8b\nparent d34ebad8539c7e897a681da17356a6836e1ef81b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788616037 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788616048 +0000\n\nAdd GitHub Actions CI to build and push images to ghcr.io\n\nAdds .github/workflows/docker-build-push.yml, which builds each service''s\nDockerfile and pushes it to ghcr.io, building only the services whose\ndirectory changed (via dorny/paths-filter), with a workflow_dispatch/tag\noverride to force a full rebuild. Images target linux/arm64 to match the\nactual k3s VM, not linux/amd64.\n\nAlso fixes worker-service-go/Dockerfile, which hardcoded GOARCH=amd64 -\nharmless under the old Docker Compose flow but silently wrong for\nKubernetes: a multi-arch build for the arm64 cluster node would have kept\nproducing an amd64 binary that can''t run there. Now cross-compiles via\nbuildx''s TARGETOS/TARGETARCH build args.\n\nPoints 04-worker-deployment.yaml at the new ghcr.io image and documents\nthe ghcr pull-secret setup and the (optional) switch from manually\n`docker save`-ing the node-typescript sandbox image into containerd to\njust pulling it from ghcr.io like everything else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y43hZPHGj7PwdjuQS9fp31\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAsPWjfw\n4lFijW0083KlK70PDtw31Znat0gOGnJB0eykE520QH7STEhx01xzIW4rfhTU7Iu8vN0W/zeglW89\nMgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-05T13:47:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VX