api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakwinkler","id":4256191,"login":"jakwinkler","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTYxOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/commits/2ce39297f580d26982ccbd20ce7e37c955ef39e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T13:58:38Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T13:58:38Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"message":"Features 05-07, checklist activity logging, inline editing & real-time updates\n\n- Feature 05: Inline editing on issue list (EditableCell, InlineSelect, InlineDatePicker)\n- Feature 06: Keyboard shortcuts (g d, j/k/Enter, a/s, grouped help dialog)\n- Feature 07: @mentions in comments with notifications (TipTap Mention extension)\n- Checklist plugin: activity log integration (add/complete/reopen/rename/remove)\n- Real-time: WebSocket hook invalidates activity on checklist events\n- Fix: priority editable from issue detail sidebar via dropdown\n- Fix: activity log 500 on non-UUID status values\n- Fix: activity_logs.user_id now nullable for plugin-created entries\n- Dashboard, profile, system settings, public projects pages\n- Plugin dynamic loading, wrapper components, plugin context\n- Pagination, sortable headers, drag-and-drop support\n- E2e tests: realtime (7), mentions (5), drag-and-drop\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f95046bf4af05194e45d