kler/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakwinkler","id":4256191,"login":"jakwinkler","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTYxOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/commits/603d2720fb7c03933cbbb041c55b088d69d8b2a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T10:59:50Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T10:59:50Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"message":"Fix React types conflict and add generic attachment upload support\n\n- Add pnpm.overrides to pin @types/react@18 across all workspace packages\n  (resolves conflict between @weaver/ui''s React 19 types and web app''s React 18)\n- Update plugin-timer to use peer dependencies for react/lucide-react\n- Add skipLibCheck to web app tsconfig for cross-package type compatibility\n- Add useGenericUploadAttachment hook for uploading files without issue context\n- Update RichTextEditor to use generic upload endpoint when no issueKey is provided,\n  enabling image paste/drop in project description editors\n- Add express as direct dependency in apps/api (was only transitive via @nestjs/platform-express)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"794b59f832f8dfe1ef3ffc5641da83171597c163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/git/trees/794b59f832f8dfe1ef3ffc5641da83171597c163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/git/commits/603d2720fb7c03933cbbb041c55b088d69d