api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakwinkler","id":4256191,"login":"jakwinkler","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTYxOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakwinkler","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/commits/2394344f82cdccd1e4634e053ae1e3e7fdb1db55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T10:02:18Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T10:02:18Z","email":"jwinkler@qoliber.com","name":"Jakub Winkler"},"message":"Rich text editor, issue activity tabs, cookie auth & draft persistence\n\nBackend:\n- Add cookie-parser middleware and CORS credentials support\n- Set httpOnly weaver_token cookie on login/register/refresh for browser auth\n- JWT strategy accepts both Bearer header and cookie token\n- Tenant middleware decodes tenantId from JWT cookie for browser-initiated requests\n- Add GET /attachments/:id/download endpoint for streaming file downloads\n- Add POST /attachments/upload endpoint for generic file uploads (not tied to issues)\n- Make AttachmentEntity.issueId nullable for standalone uploads\n- Add generic upload() method to AttachmentsService\n- Add express as direct dependency for auth controller Response type\n- Add events module and plugin timer plugin scaffolding\n\nFrontend:\n- Integrate Tiptap rich text editor with full toolbar (bold, italic, strike,\n  headings H1-H3, bullet/ordered lists, blockquote, code block, link, image)\n- Support image paste from clipboard and drag-and-drop file upload\n- Generic upload path for editors without issue context (project descriptions)\n- Shared RichTextEditor component at src/components/ with re-export barrel\n- Backward-compatible normalizeCommentBody() handles JSON strings, plain text,\n  and legacy {text: \"...\"} format\n- serializeDoc() stores rich text as JSON string in text columns\n- Add @tailwindcss/typography plugin with comprehensive .tiptap CSS styles\n  for headings, lists, blockquotes, code blocks, links, images, and syntax\n  highlighting via lowlight\n\nIssue Detail Page:\n- Replace stacked Comments/Activity/TimeTracking sections with tabbed layout\n- Four tabs: Comments, Logs, All (unified timeline), Attachments\n- Comments tab: rich text editor with draft persistence, formatted comment display\n- Logs tab: activity entries (excludes comments) + time tracking\n- All tab: chronological merge of comments, activity, and time entries\n- Attachments tab: drag-and-drop upload zone, file grid with thumbnails,\n  download/delete actions, count badge on tab\n\nDraft Persistence:\n- localStorage-based comment drafts per issue (weaver:comment-draft:<key>)\n- 500ms debounced auto-save, clear on submit, restore on page revisit\n\nProject Descriptions:\n- ProjectDetailPage: read-only formatted description with edit icon on hover\n  (permission-gated to projects.update or superadmin)\n- ProjectSettingsPage: read-only by default with Edit/Cancel toggle\n- ProjectsPage: rich text editor in create project form\n- All project description fields use serializeDoc/normalizeCommentBody\n\nAPI Client:\n- Add withCredentials: true for cookie-based auth\n- Export API_BASE_URL for attachment download URLs\n- Add useGenericUploadAttachment hook for non-issue uploads\n- Add useAttachments, useDeleteAttachment hooks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e5ae02c055b140e5ab1157ef0ffc19c95c34a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jakwinkler/weaver/git/trees/5e5ae02c055b140e5ab1157ef