rs/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/288fba62904f149a71eb0ac930185497796572c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:35:47Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:35:47Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): patch Studio web undici and markdown-it transitives\n\nFourteen Dependabot alerts opened on 2026-09-29 against\nstudio-web/pnpm-lock.yaml. Thirteen concern undici, including two high\nadvisories (GHSA-w293-vg96-wgc3 and GHSA-vp8m-p9jh-q5pm), fixed in 7.29.1\nand 8.10.2. The fourteenth is markdown-it GHSA-253c-mchw-3w2r, fixed in\n14.3.1.\n\nThe undici overrides were crossed. jsdom 30.1 declares ^8.10.2 but was\nforced onto 7.x, and @module-federation/dts-plugin 2.9 pins 7.29.0 but was\nforced onto 8.x. Each consumer now receives the patched line of the major\nit declares: jsdom gets 8.11.2, dts-plugin gets 7.30.0. markdown-it is\nbounded to typedoc''s major (14.3.2). The lockfile keeps its source header.\n\nVerified with pnpm install --frozen-lockfile, typecheck, lint, prettier,\nvitest (104 tests), vite build and typedoc.\n\nSeat: b52b\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"e9b7db4e1f343360bedaba199723e49a1031e3a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/trees/e9b7db4e1f343360bedaba199723e49a1031e3a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/commits/288fba62904f149a71eb0ac930185497796572c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verif