mments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:14:15Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:14:15Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"chore(licence): name this project in the LICENSE notice and retire 1998\n\nThe \"How to Apply\" notice in LICENSE named SCPN Fusion Core with a 1998\nstart year. It now names SCPN Control with the canonical concepts (1996)\nand code (2020) years, the SPDX identifier and the commercial-licence\nroute; the rest of LICENSE is byte-identical to the FSF AGPL-3.0 text.\nNOTICE.md and 154 legacy banner lines below the canonical file headers\ncarried the same 1998 start year and now read 1996; no other header\ncontent changed.\n\nTests check the licence text against the FSF original, the licence\ndeclared on pyproject, CITATION, Zenodo, Cargo and npm manifests, and\nevery tracked file for piped SPDX expressions or the retired year.\n\nSeat: b52b\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"0f8753d242b93bea55bd31ed447d2aa746538510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/trees/0f8753d242b93bea55bd31ed447d2aa746538510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/commits/11fbc9cc4b387e7d6b5ae04143c5684cc37aad2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_ev