 Šotek"},"message":"fix(metadata): use Zenodo-accepted relation types and cite the concept DOI\n\n.zenodo.json named isAlternateIdentifier and isRelatedTo, which are not in\nthe Zenodo relation-type vocabulary; the latest Zenodo version is 0.4.0\n(2026-03-01). The PyPI distribution is now isVariantFormOf, and\nscpn-fusion-core and scpn-quantum-control are references, matching the\noptional FUSION solver extra and the lazily imported quantum bridge.\n\nCITATION.cff labelled record 10.5281/zenodo.18821816 as v0.17.0; Zenodo\nreports it as v0.4.0. The top-level DOI is now the concept DOI, which the\nREADME badge already uses, until the cited version is archived.\n\nTests pin every relation to the vocabulary, bind the sibling relations to\nthe package dependency contract and check the citation DOI.\n\nSeat: b52b\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b8476e59498bbf4ff35803caa7e53799360090a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/trees/b8476e59498bbf4ff35803caa7e53799360090a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/commits/a8e7799e43bba51941efdc3684af2f4954dc5184","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.c