182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/67f898684ed8cd0e46c8afc35cc9506849aedabe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:38Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:53:38Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"fix(control): bind checkpoint digest to loaded bytes\n\nSnapshot checkpoint bytes in a bounded temporary file, hash that copy, and pass the same copy to Torch. Preserve pin and public facade contracts while extracting integrity into a focused module. A real Torch path-swap test proves that renamed weights cannot inherit the original digest.\n\nParity: no non-Python checkpoint loader counterpart found in scoped repository search. Benchmarks: no checkpoint load benchmark reference found; no recorded result changed. Gates: 30 checkpoint tests, 18 safe API tests, strict mypy, Ruff, clean-worktree traceability validation and generated-doc check pass.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"3a08d1e8d621369d83baac1fd3c800f540fa6bca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-contr