ulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/f85d7d1fda33264108fdd6ea53f0b7cef782259b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:56:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:56:19Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"chore(deps): align uv.lock with the CI pins where the graph permits\n\nThe developer lock and the hash-locked CI requirements resolved different\nversions of the packages whose stubs drive the type check, so no local mypy run\nreproduced the CI job. Move the three that are reachable to the exact CI\nvalues: click 8.4.1 to 8.5.0, osqp 1.1.1 to 1.1.3, and pydantic 2.13.4 to\n2.13.5 with its pydantic-core 2.46.5.\n\nnumpy stays at 1.26.4 and cannot be aligned. The `fusion` extra pulls\n`scpn-fusion 4.0.0`, the latest published release, which requires\n`numpy>=1.24,<2.0`; forcing `numpy>=2.2` makes the graph unsatisfiable. The CI\ntype-check job reaches numpy 2.2.6 only because it installs a narrower set —\n`requirements/ci-deps.txt`, `ci-test.txt`, `ci-neuro.txt`, `ci-studio.txt` and\n`ci-imas.txt` — that never includes the fusion extra. scipy is likewise\nunaligned in the other direction: the lock resolves 1.17.1 against CI''s 1.15.3.\nThis is a structural consequence of the extras layout plus an upstream cap, not\nlock staleness, and closing it needs either a `scpn-fusion` release supporting\nnumpy 2.x or a dedicated CONTROL dependency group that excludes the fusion\nextra for type checking.\n\nVerification: `uv lock --check --offline` resolves 176 packages; the diff moves\nexactly the four intended version lines. With the environment synced to these\npins and the pinned `scpn-studio-platform==0.8.0` SDK installed, local\n`python -m mypy` drops from 37 findings to 31, and all 31 were confirmed to be\nnumpy 1.26 versus 2.2 stub artefacts — redundant casts on\n`floating[_64Bit]`, `loadtxt` overload selection, and `leggauss`/`laggauss`\nbeing untyped in the older stubs. Scoped pre-commit passed.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: aeb4","tree":{"sha":"10bce581bbb9b5fb663962c858b39f2f5fa81266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/trees/10bce581bbb9b5fb663962c858b39f2f5fa81266"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/commits/f85d7d1fda33264108fdd6ea53f0b7cef782259b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-control/commit/f85d7d1fda33264108fdd6ea53f0b7cef782259b","node_id":"C_kwDORT5DBdoAKGY4NWQ3ZDFmZGEzMzI2NDEwOGZkZDZlYTUzZjBiN2NlZjc4MjI1OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-control/commit/146dfaa2ff49490d4d2a9b58330531b0682edde4","sha":"146dfaa2ff49490d4d2a9b58330531b0682edde4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/146dfaa2ff49490d4d2a9b58330531b0682edde4"}],"sha":"f85d7d1fda33264108fdd6ea53f0b7cef782259b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/f85d7d1fda33264108fdd6ea53f0b7cef782259b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/commits/146dfaa2ff49490d4d2a9b58330531b0682edde4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:34:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:34:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"chore(toolchain): reconcile ruff and mypy pins across all three declarations\n\nThe repository declared its lint and type tools three times in three\ngenerations. `requirements/ci-lint.txt` and `requirements/ci-test.txt` were\nadvanced on 2026-09-19 while `.pre-commit-config.yaml` (unchanged since\n2026-09-08) and `uv.lock` were left behind, so a developer check, a commit-hook\ncheck and the CI job each ran a different ruff and mypy on the same source.\n\nAlign every declaration on the hash-locked CI pins:\n\n- `.pre-commit-config.yaml`: ruff v0.15.17 to v0.16.8, mypy v2.2.0 to v2.3.1.\n- `.pre-commit-config.yaml`: mypy stub dependencies click 8.4.1 to 8.5.0 and\n  pydantic 2.13.4 to 2.13.5, restoring the file''s own stated requirement that\n  they match `requirements/`; numpy, scipy and osqp already agreed.\n- `uv.lock`: ruff 0.15.14 to 0.16.8 and mypy 2.1.0 to 2.3.1, with the\n  transitive ast-serialize 0.11.2 and librt 0.15.0 the resolver requires.\n\nVerification: `uv lock --check --offline` resolves 176 packages unchanged;\n`pip check` clean. All four gate-scoped ruff commands pass under 0.16.8 —\n`check src/scpn_control/`, `format --check src/scpn_control/ tests/`,\n`check validation/control_benchmark_suite.py tests/test_control_benchmark_suite.py`,\n`format --check validation/control_benchmark_suite.py`. A controlled A/B in one\nenvironment confirmed mypy 2.1.0 and 2.3.1 report the identical 37 findings, so\nthe bump introduces no new type error; those 37 trace to local runtime packages\nthat differ from the CI pins and are recorded separately. Scoped pre-commit\npassed on both files, installing the new hook environments.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: aeb4","tree":{"sha":"41092572d44e8c838189b796e6b72da4366b18c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/trees/41092572d44e8c838189b796e6b72da4366b18c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-control/git/commits/146dfaa2ff49490d4d2a9b58330531b0682edde4","verification":{"payload":null,"r