d tests for new loading behavior and pagination functionality.\n\n* feat: enhance ShowDetail components with poster image support and layout improvements\n\n- Updated ShowDetailSkeleton.vue to improve layout and add a backdrop for the poster.\n- Modified use-show-detail.ts to include a new posterImage ref and logic for selecting the poster image.\n- Enhanced ShowDetailView.vue to display the poster image alongside the backdrop and show additional metadata.\n- Added tests in use-show-detail.spec.ts to verify poster image selection logic.\n- Updated ShowDetailView.spec.ts to ensure proper rendering of the poster image in the view.","tree":{"sha":"0600db6874d76561be2e0b444d1dcf5737fcc652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peimanfarajnezhad/tv-maze-explorer/git/trees/0600db6874d76561be2e0b444d1dcf5737fcc652"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peimanfarajnezhad/tv-maze-explorer/git/commits/cc5a8a6c98490e82ef4cb55f41812aa2e6c72d30","verification":{"payload":"tree 0600db6874d76561be2e0b444d1dcf5737fcc652\nparent 24824e0f2ac35a6323631c407f5a625fe3902dfd\nauthor Peiman Farajnezhad <8276294+peimanfarajnezhad@users.noreply.github.com> 1771611360 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771611360 +0100\n\nShow Detail hero redesign & major optimizations (#5)\n\n* refactor: rename project and update dependencies; enhance loading state management\n\n- Renamed project from \"abn-amro-tv-maze\" to \"tv-maze-explorer\" and updated version to 0.1.0.\n- Upgraded \"reka-ui\" dependency from version 2.8.0 to 2.8.2.\n- Improved loading state management in App.vue to display a loading screen while data is being fetched.\n- Added new Empty component structure for better UI handling during loading states.\n- Updated composables to improve genre handling and pagination logic.\n- Added tests for new loading behavior and pagination functionality.\n\n* feat: enhance ShowDetail components with poster image support and layout improvements\n\n- Updated ShowDetailSkeleton.vue to improve layout and add a backdrop for the poster.\n- Modified use-show-detail.ts to include a new posterImage ref and logic for selecting the poster image.\n- Enhanced ShowDetailView.vue to display the poster image alongside the backdrop and show additional metadata.\n- Added tests in use-show-detail.spec.ts to verify poster image selection logic.\n- Updated ShowDetailView.spec.ts to ensure proper rendering of the poster image in the view.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpmKTgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyCsQAA1M9LWsKtLBWNcLTLbLNuXh\ne4p7pG3dZNWDenbHtTbmU42El/rMF+2l7sySHGLD6mrLR3RozCUugXpo3fTb2rbp\nEIbhrB38BpEVOD0TmcqcfhC65n/FsRboWGVRcNz7ScTcoowOpKoUTxKOv3X7DEfd\nIz+Hs1Pa6eEEm24ennN0z3Rhj6SAkbCW3P9SqURMXsacppNcUYF64eXnG5H8xbHK\nH4ig0t3Dj62GW12YCYNOYUTxJ433f0pRQnre92/9gsN87Ax54nsiaKtIv7AJnd9R\nzLH0OzZXhEDfaY5a4ULeDlbbvxdu1tkvRD9q2WljYw5s6wkcPB3Y2dQicwQ7ko35\ncDB3eDSdl8a4+Phyt7oOUgh4Py213qYP4XUGQY7y9DMa0BspDAhKBLhSfHbEHzj+\n/HCcqsKCukR+G8mlwm2avpA2J+eooVCRmy1rFNTGbkYn4FNAXzkb1b0EG4ZDAnkZ\neCVbzZPCwEiDoAcY9mOSOcAyF4NoLQ7KrH7/KMrHGXKoAkd/uqO4Bc65V5cOa6TV\nZexa0FGN/ObPFm9jLkcHhlxxNXVRStWfnzC7Ml17+cnZEmXSEkUTdnlbEhi8ARSn\nkGb8tacEvF5PLX93LRED/RtmcQEa1cjFb+1oeYMqdQNKrCz8x/V/ZdiJvVB33k/1\nHHdjCAJ6tKHjPQFmBIi1\n=R6j9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-20T18:16:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github