count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T04:18:04Z","email":"dev@localvibe.in","name":"LocalVibe Dev"},"message":"feat: Build complete web app, admin panel, and backend admin endpoints\n\nWeb App (apps/web/):\n- Home page with hero section, featured businesses, search bar, stats, categories\n- Login / Register pages with form validation\n- Business Discovery page with map view and list view toggle\n- Business Profile page with reviews, gallery, contact info\n- Search Results page with filters (category, rating, distance)\n- Job Search page with filters (type, experience, remote)\n- Offers & Deals page with discount cards and filters\n- User Profile / Dashboard page with stats and activity\n- Responsive design with mobile-first approach\n- Redux store with auth, business, and UI slices\n- API service layer connecting to backend gateway\n- LocalVibe branding: primary orange (#FF7A00), dark gray, light gray, blue accent\n\nAdmin Panel (apps/admin/):\n- Admin Login page with dark theme\n- Dashboard with overview stats (users, businesses, jobs, offers, reviews)\n- All Posts/Listings view with status filters (pending/approved/rejected)\n- Approve/Reject functionality for content moderation\n- User Management with search, role filter, activate/deactivate\n- Business Management with status tracking\n- Category Management with business counts\n- Content Moderation queue for flagged content\n- Analytics overview with charts and trends\n\nBackend Updates (apps/user-service/):\n- Added postStatus enum (pending, approved, rejected) to schema\n- Added status and rejectionReason fields to businesses, jobs, offers tables\n- Created AdminController with full CRUD operations\n- Admin routes: /api/admin/stats, posts, users, businesses, categories\n- Approve/reject endpoints: PATCH /api/admin/posts/:id/approve|reject\n- Approved content endpoints: /api/approved/businesses|jobs|offers\n- All admin routes protected with auth + admin role authorization","tree":{"sha":"232f6a688bc8f7122d25f11095cda603a3fd8339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/trees/232f6a688bc8f7122d25f11095cda603a3fd8339"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/commits/0735638d0f7a2854db7fa898075063e47cd88c64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/0735638d0f7a2854db7fa898075063e47cd88c64","node_id":"C_kwDORUbIVtoAKDA3MzU2MzhkMGY3YTI4NTRkYjdmYTg5ODA3NTA2M2U0N2NkODhjNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7","sha":"53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7"}],"sha":"0735638d0f7a2854db7fa898075063e47cd88c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/0735638d0f7a2854db7fa898075063e47cd88c64"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T02:55:54Z","email":"manus-agent@manus.im","name":"Manus Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T02:55:54Z","email":"manus-agent@manus.im","name":"Manus Agent"},"message":"fix(render): add missing Redis Key Value service definition\n\nThe render.yaml referenced a Redis instance called ''localvibe-redis''\nin the REDIS_URL env vars for both localvibe-user-service and\nlocalvibe-business-service, but the service was never defined in the\nBlueprint — causing Blueprint sync to fail with an unresolved reference.\n\nFix: Add a proper Key Value service definition (type: keyvalue, which is\nthe current Render spec; ''redis'' is a supported deprecated alias used in\nthe fromService references). The instance uses:\n  - plan: free  (Render Key Value supports a free tier)\n  - region: oregon  (matches all other services)\n  - maxmemoryPolicy: allkeys-lru  (suitable for caching / rate limiting)\n  - ipAllowList: []  (internal-only access from other Render services)\n\nThe Key Value service belongs in the top-level ''services'' list, not\nunder ''databases'' — the previous file had it commented out in the wrong\nsection.","tree":{"sha":"cc712c98998ff0f8487c2c5dfceb635609b8c89c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/trees/cc712c98998ff0f8487c2c5dfceb635609b8c89c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/commits/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7","node_id":"C_kwDORUbIVtoAKDUzMjkyYWVjMDVlN2Q3OWQ3ODRlZThmYTdjY2FkNTk0OTYyYmEzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261","sha":"23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261"}],"sha":"53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/53292aec05e7d79d784ee8fa7ccad594962ba3e7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T13:08:40Z","email":"manus-ai@localvibe.dev","name":"Manus AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T13:08:40Z","email":"manus-ai@localvibe.dev","name":"Manus AI"},"message":"feat: migrate MySQL to PostgreSQL and add Render deployment config\n\nDatabase Migration (MySQL → PostgreSQL):\n- Replace drizzle-orm/mysql-core with drizzle-orm/pg-core in schema.ts\n  - mysqlTable → pgTable, mysqlEnum → pgEnum\n  - int().autoincrement() → serial()\n  - Remove onUpdateNow() (not supported in PostgreSQL)\n  - Declare all enums as top-level pgEnum exports\n- Replace mysql2 driver with postgres.js (postgres@^3.4.4) in:\n  - apps/user-service/src/config/database.ts\n  - apps/user-service/package.json\n  - apps/business-service/package.json\n- Update drizzle.config.ts: dialect mysql → postgresql, use url credential\n- Update migrate.ts: drizzle-orm/mysql2/migrator → drizzle-orm/postgres-js/migrator\n- Update seed.ts: poolConnection.end() → queryClient.end()\n- Update config/index.ts: export queryClient + closeDatabaseConnection\n- Update server.ts: graceful shutdown now closes pg connection pool\n- Fix all MySQL insertId patterns → PostgreSQL .returning() in:\n  - auth.controller.ts (register)\n  - business.controller.ts (create)\n  - category.controller.ts (create)\n- Update .env.example files for both user-service and business-service:\n  - Port 3306 → 5432, user root → postgres\n  - Add DATABASE_URL as primary connection string option\n\nRender Deployment Configuration:\n- Add render.yaml (Blueprint IaC) at repo root:\n  - localvibe-gateway (Web Service)\n  - localvibe-user-service (Web Service)\n  - localvibe-business-service (Web Service)\n  - localvibe-db (Render Managed PostgreSQL 16)\n  - Redis note with instructions for paid/free tier\n  - Environment variable references using fromDatabase and fromService\n  - Health check paths configured for each service\n- Add Dockerfiles for user-service, business-service, and gateway\n  - Multi-stage builds (deps + runner) on node:20-alpine\n  - HEALTHCHECK instructions using wget\n- Add .dockerignore at repo root\n\nREADME Updates:\n- Update Backend Services table: MySQL → PostgreSQL\n- Update Prerequisites: MySQL 8.0+ → PostgreSQL 14+\n- Add Database Migrations section with migration commands\n- Update Technology Stack: MySQL → PostgreSQL, add Redis\n- Add Deployment with Render section with step-by-step instructions","tree":{"sha":"b93328bd23f57ba90447dad915a33e7fc0f289f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/trees/b93328bd23f57ba90447dad915a33e7fc0f289f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/commits/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261","node_id":"C_kwDORUbIVtoAKDIzY2Q1ZTMyOGM5ZDE1ZDkyNzY5NTFjNWYwZmY5ZmUyZDFmY2QyNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commit/963aa98a07f0c9482e02d9a242d2045c84ef007f","sha":"963aa98a07f0c9482e02d9a242d2045c84ef007f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/963aa98a07f0c9482e02d9a242d2045c84ef007f"}],"sha":"23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/23cd5e328c9d15d9276951c5f0ff9fe2d1fcd261"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236099260?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913","id":236099260,"login":"sunilbittu913","node_id":"U_kgDODhKWvA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/commits/963aa98a07f0c9482e02d9a242d2045c84ef007f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-20T04:01:08Z","email":"sunilbittu913@gmail.com","name":"sunilbittu913"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-20T04:01:08Z","email":"sunilbittu913@gmail.com","name":"sunilbittu913"},"message":"feat: initialize LocalVibe Nx monorepo with microservices architecture\n\n- Set up Nx workspace with proper configuration (nx.json, tsconfig.base.json)\n- Create frontend apps: web (port 4200), admin (port 4201) with React + TypeScript + Vite + TailwindCSS\n- Create mobile app with React Native + Expo\n- Create backend services: user-service (port 3001), business-service (port 3002), gateway (port 3000)\n- Create shared libraries: shared-types, shared-utils, ui-components\n- Migrate Phase 1 backend code from riders-admin-ui/localvibe-backend into user-service\n- Configure module boundary rules with scope tags (shared, backend, frontend, mobile)\n- Set up path aliases for @localvibe/* shared libraries\n- Add LocalVibe branding (primary orange #FF7A00, accent blue #007BFF)","tree":{"sha":"8b21678dd2c83c8281dee7e123963c3a3c617427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/trees/8b21678dd2c83c8281dee7e123963c3a3c617427"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sunilbittu913/localvibe/git/commits/963aa98a07f0c9482e02d9a242d2045c84ef007f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236099260?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sunilbittu913/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sunilbittu913","id":236099260,"login":"sunilbittu913","node_id