m/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commit/459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0","sha":"459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commits/459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0"}],"sha":"a191b4063cdeddfc38ee2ca16509955b8a0b2615","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commits/a191b4063cdeddfc38ee2ca16509955b8a0b2615"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31503196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mirdev","id":31503196,"login":"Mirdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTAzMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commits/459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T03:26:28Z","email":"mepbphh@gmail.com","name":"Mirdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T03:26:28Z","email":"mepbphh@gmail.com","name":"Mirdev"},"message":"refactor(simulation): 시뮬레이터 아키텍처 오버홀 및 전체 코드 정합성 확보\n\n기존 시뮬레이터의 중앙 집중식 상태 관리와 솔버의 I/O 병목으로 인해 발생하던\n결과 왜곡 및 로직 크래시(Crash) 문제를 해결하고, 객체지향적 무결성을 복원함.\n더불어 모든 코드의 개발 시차간 파편화된 코드를 내/외부적 정합성을 검토하고 수정함\n\n- [구조] 엔진 팩토리 패턴 도입: 매 시뮬레이션 루프마다 독립된 엔진 인스턴스를 신규 생성하여, 솔버 간 상태 오염(State Contamination) 원천 차단\n- [버그 수정] 모든 소스코드 내/외부적 정합성 복원\n- [기능] 5x4x3 그리드 서치 고도화: 자릿수(3~5, LUT), 게임 규칙(4종), 솔버(3종) 교차 검증 체계 구축 및 4대 핵심 지표(Avg, Max, Iter, Total) 출력 로직 정립\n- [UI/UX] 동적 프로그레스 바 적용: 연산 시작 시 0% 강제 출력 및 제어 문자()를 활용한 단일 줄 진행률 갱신 로직 구현\n\nResolves: #36","tree":{"sha":"e74e6f63c69fbba8fc3915db036c6eb44a74bc14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/git/trees/e74e6f63c69fbba8fc3915db036c6eb44a74bc14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/git/commits/459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31503196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mirdev","id":31503196,"login":"Mirdev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTAzMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mirdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commit/459968cb64b28ec8cc747f0c1a1ab1e3d24c0ab0","node_id":"C_kwDORUm6x9oAKDQ1OTk2OGNiNjRiMjhlYzhjYzc0N2YwYzFhMWFiMWUzZDI0YzBhYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commit/a07f78a8dca3731df0d2a9b68e1f5c612074ee1b","sha":"a07f78a8dca3731df0d2a9b68e1f5c612074ee1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mirdev/mastermind-solver/commits/a07f78a8dca3731df0d2a9b68e1f5c612074ee1b"}],"sha":"459968cb64b28ec8cc7