ranches, add vercel.json for explicit env mapping\n\n- ci.yml: changed trigger branches from [main, staging] to [master, staging]\n  so CI actually runs on the default branch\n- vercel.json: added to explicitly declare master (production) and staging\n  deployments; prevents Vercel from deploying unintended branches\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PJ6Pn5Wry6FXVH59ehLTXP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIhlkhzf\n4+GbIxETAugt1gWPh3z1kcE+O18bmAQ82cyUnnFjJxn672HexqqEnCmlhV4pHuxx7AHu8gllF+fo\n3g0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-11T08:31:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/65aa85463da2d9910dea041d8e1b0d932a06f3ef","node_id":"C_kwDORUokoNoAKDY1YWE4NTQ2M2RhMmQ5OTEwZGVhMDQxZDhlMWIwZDkzMmEwNmYzZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/6aad920b81feef48c291dea454e122260744a212","sha":"6aad920b81feef48c291dea454e122260744a212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/6aad920b81feef48c291dea454e122260744a212"}],"sha":"65aa85463da2d9910dea041d8e1b0d932a06f3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/65aa85463da2d9910dea041d8e1b0d932a06f3ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/6aad920b81feef48c291dea454e122260744a212/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T14:02:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T14:02:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: swipe quiz image speed + recommendation image URL path mismatch\n\nStyle quiz image speed (still slow after first attempt):\n- Previous fix used Next.js Image width={1} which pre-fetched a 16px optimised\n  version — completely different cache entry from the 440-828px card image.\n- Root fix: add unoptimized to SwipeCardItem Image so images are served directly\n  from Next.js static files (/products/...) with no server-side processing overhead.\n  Static file serving is typically <100ms vs 1-3s for cold image optimization.\n- Replace broken 1x1 preload with useEffect using native new window.Image() which\n  correctly preloads the same raw URL the card will use.\n\nRecommendation images showing placeholder:\n- Root cause: ingest script generates URLs like /products/polo-s/HB36728_FN.jpg\n  (slugify(\"POLO_S\") = \"polo-s\") but images are in /products/polos/HB36728_FN.jpg.\n  Same mismatch for jackets, sport-jackets, tall-mix, trousers, accessories.\n- CatalogRepository: add normalizeImageUrl() that maps wrong slugified paths to the\n  correct directory names on read. Applied to both _hydrate() and getSwipeCandidates().\n- ingest-catalog.ts: add CATEGORY_DIR_OVERRIDE map so future ingest runs write\n  correct URLs to the DB, eliminating the need for the normalizer over time.\n\nNOTE: This commit is on the feature branch (staging). Please test at the staging\nURL before merging to main.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PJ6Pn5Wry6FXVH59ehLTXP","tree":{"sha":"2189780acc9a48ae955336a562d8f950f34d1911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/trees/2189780acc9a48ae955336a562d8f950f34d1911"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/commits/6aad920b81feef48c291dea454e122260744a212","verification":{"payload":"tree 2189780acc9a48ae955336a562d8f950f34d1911\nparent 407c517a11d8d2b76074cdd5606704d44fc5d541\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773151366 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773151366 +0000\n\nfix: swipe quiz image speed + recommendation image URL path mismatch\n\nStyle quiz image speed (still slow after first attempt):\n- Previous fix used Next.js Image width={1} which pre-fetched a 16px optimised\n  version — completely different cache entry from the 440-828px card image.\n- Root fix: add unoptimized to SwipeCardItem Image so images are served directly\n  from Next.js static files (/products/...) with no server-side processing overhead.\n  Static file serving is typically <100ms vs 1-3s for cold image optimization.\n- Replace broken 1x1 preload with useEffect using native new window.Image() which\n  correctly preloads the same raw URL the card will use.\n\nRecommendation images showing placeholder:\n- Root cause: ingest script generates URLs like /products/polo-s/HB36728_FN.jpg\n  (slugify(\"POLO_S\") = \"polo-s\") but images are in /products/polos/HB36728_FN.jpg.\n  Same mismatch for jackets, sport-jackets, tall-mix, trousers, accessories.\n- CatalogRepository: add normalizeImageUrl() that maps wrong slugified paths to the\n  correct directory names on read. Applied to both _hydrate() and getSwipeCandidates().\n- ingest-catalog.ts: add CATEGORY_DIR_OVERRIDE map so future ingest runs write\n  correct URLs to the DB, eliminating the need for the normalizer over time.\n\nNOTE: This commit is on the feature branch (staging). Please test at the staging\nURL before merging to main.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PJ6Pn5Wry6FXVH59ehLTXP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCKjYufP\ny0zDeZxMLRoFy4zkLKdHjYje0vvMAgeB1G/3mtR525iSkza6dc93oNdBdiqzrzgaQzXEbfte0ZDm\n4gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T14:02:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url"