n- Add db/migrations/004_session_signals.sql — session_signals table was missing from\n  production schema; product-view route was inserting into a non-existent table\n- Fix SQL in recommendations/home: wrong table names (customers→profiles, customer_id→user_id)\n- Fix PDP page (products/[slug]/page.tsx): was importing catalog provider directly,\n  bypassing the API gateway; now fetches /api/gateway/products/<slug> via fetch()\n\nHIGH fixes:\n- Fix session/route.ts: returned onboardingDone but AuthContext expected onboardingComplete,\n  causing an infinite redirect loop to /onboarding for all authenticated users\n- Replace static ProductGrid with live gateway fetch + skeleton loading + PDP links\n- Fix Recommendations.tsx: auth error branch called setDataState(\"loggedOut\") instead of\n  setDataState(\"error\"), breaking the Playwright recs-error test\n- Fix layout.tsx: switch from next/font/google (network at build time) to geist npm package\n\nMEDIUM fixes:\n- Add Content-Security-Policy header to next.config.ts\n- Fix prefer-const lint error in api/context/route.ts:41\n- Add MOCK_CI_ENABLED to src/lib/env.ts Zod schema\n- Add npm run migrate script to package.json\n\nNew files:\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — lint/typecheck/build/Playwright/audit on every PR\n- .env.example — documents all required environment variables\n- db/migrations/004_session_signals.sql\n- SCAN_REPORT.md — full audit findings (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\n- ARCHITECTURE.md — system design, gateway pattern, provider interfaces\n- RELEASE.md — dev→staging→production release process with rollback instructions\n- SELL_READY_CHECKLIST.md — pre-launch checklist\n- LOCAL_DEV_SETUP.md — step-by-step local development guide\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PJ6Pn5Wry6FXVH59ehLTXP","tree":{"sha":"32e3f3c13b0463ec1843c86ec32ee04076c8c224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/trees/32e3f3c13b0463ec1843c86ec32ee04076c8c224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/commits/f720d6ffe72d727c421881357f9716bd90ab769f","verification":{"payload":"tree 32e3f3c13b0463ec1843c86ec32ee04076c8c224\nparent 1f615ae2732dc6543f9f987b230e66c289668183\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773148716 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1773148716 +0000\n\nscan-and-fix: comprehensive audit, critical/high/medium fixes, docs\n\nCRITICAL fixes:\n- Remove ~41MB binary asset folders from git tracking (.gitignore + git rm --cached)\n- Add db/migrations/004_session_signals.sql — session_signals table was missing from\n  production schema; product-view route was inserting into a non-existent table\n- Fix SQL in recommendations/home: wrong table names (customers→profiles, customer_id→user_id)\n- Fix PDP page (products/[slug]/page.tsx): was importing catalog provider directly,\n  bypassing the API gateway; now fetches /api/gateway/products/<slug> via fetch()\n\nHIGH fixes:\n- Fix session/route.ts: returned onboardingDone but AuthContext expected onboardingComplete,\n  causing an infinite redirect loop to /onboarding for all authenticated users\n- Replace static ProductGrid with live gateway fetch + skeleton loading + PDP links\n- Fix Recommendations.tsx: auth error branch called setDataState(\"loggedOut\") instead of\n  setDataState(\"error\"), breaking the Playwright recs-error test\n- Fix layout.tsx: switch from next/font/google (network at build time) to geist npm package\n\nMEDIUM fixes:\n- Add Content-Security-Policy header to next.config.ts\n- Fix prefer-const lint error in api/context/route.ts:41\n- Add MOCK_CI_ENABLED to src/lib/env.ts Zod schema\n- Add npm run migrate script to package.json\n\nNew files:\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml — lint/typecheck/build/Playwright/audit on every PR\n- .env.example — documents all required environment variables\n- db/migrations/004_session_signals.sql\n- SCAN_REPORT.md — full audit findings (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\n- ARCHITECTURE.md — system design, gateway pattern, provider interfaces\n- RELEASE.md — dev→staging→production release process with rollback instructions\n- SELL_READY_CHECKLIST.md — pre-launch checklist\n- LOCAL_DEV_SETUP.md — step-by-step local development guide\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PJ6Pn5Wry6FXVH59ehLTXP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDVfC/iP\nv6Q+INjUtUNh7ThEeCgbn7KxTu8+HWEDgl6yAzQWWjzEsib4ImKCynrYEYghhQFdkEOHRi1e8DtF\nQww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T13:18:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/f720d6ffe72d727c421881357f9716bd90ab769f","node_id":"C_kwDORUokoNoAKGY3MjBkNmZmZTcyZDcyN2M0MjE4ODEzNTdmOTcxNmJkOTBhYjc2OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/1f615ae2732dc6543f9f987b230e66c289668183","sha":"1f615ae2732dc6543f9f987b230e66c289668183","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/1f61