omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T07:16:57Z","email":"miles.blair@accenture.com","name":"Blair"},"message":"feat: mock CI catalog adapter with real Kingsize product images\n\nBACKEND:\n- db/migrations/003_mock_catalog.sql - 6 new catalog tables (no changes to 002)\n- packages/contracts/src/index.ts - ICatalogProduct, ISwipeCandidate, ICatalogProvider types\n- src/integrations/ci/CatalogRepository.ts - Postgres implementation of ICatalogProvider\n- src/integrations/ci/mockCiCatalog.ts - MOCK_CI_ENABLED toggle (default: true)\n- scripts/ingest-catalog.ts - image scan + /public copy + optional R2 upload + Postgres upsert\n\nGATEWAY ENDPOINTS:\n- GET /api/gateway/products (list with filters)\n- GET /api/gateway/products/[slug] (product detail)\n- GET /api/gateway/categories (category tree)\n- GET /api/gateway/brands (brand list)\n- GET /api/gateway/swipe/candidates (swipe cards, seeded by session)\n\nIMAGES:\n- 238 real Kingsize product photos copied to public/products/{category}/\n- Served via Next.js static - zero Drive links, zero binary in git history\n\nONBOARDING:\n- StepStylePrefs fetches real product images from /api/gateway/swipe/candidates\n- Graceful fallback to static cards when catalog not yet seeded\n\nARCHITECTURE:\n- Swap to real CI: set MOCK_CI_ENABLED=false + implement CounterIntelligenceCatalogProvider\n- Swap to R2: run ingest-catalog.ts --r2 with R2_* env vars set\n- TypeScript: 0 errors","tree":{"sha":"50d2d5d93246bbc6ec2afed708220d3cceceb8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/trees/50d2d5d93246bbc6ec2afed708220d3cceceb8f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/commits/fe1674b6f7ccd1087f1c1c62561eaa65f6f386fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/fe1674b6f7ccd1087f1c1c62561eaa65f6f386fb","node_id":"C_kwDORUokoNoAKGZlMT