 flows\n\n- Integrated FitSelector and dynamic StyleBundles into homepage.\n- Connected onboarding style analysis to /api/gateway/personalization/swipe for persistence.\n- Added FitSelector to account profile tab.\n- Integrated swipe batch API locally for snapshot management.\n- Verified with clean production build and unit tests (11 passed).","tree":{"sha":"5edf17a7be4e44e2f99adf4aeba8bf153c61d3d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/trees/5edf17a7be4e44e2f99adf4aeba8bf153c61d3d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/commits/a2a62ff8ef4babf077e6cc4f6afb16be2c5a77e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/a2a62ff8ef4babf077e6cc4f6afb16be2c5a77e0","node_id":"C_kwDORUokoNoAKGEyYTYyZmY4ZWY0YmFiZjA3N2U2Y2M0ZjZhZmIxNmJlMmM1YTc3ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commit/849d697bd12d995aa102ca16edd4115a222bfe77","sha":"849d697bd12d995aa102ca16edd4115a222bfe77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/849d697bd12d995aa102ca16edd4115a222bfe77"}],"sha":"a2a62ff8ef4babf077e6cc4f6afb16be2c5a77e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/a2a62ff8ef4babf077e6cc4f6afb16be2c5a77e0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/commits/849d697bd12d995aa102ca16edd4115a222bfe77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T18:04:37Z","email":"miles.blair@accenture.com","name":"Blair"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T18:04:37Z","email":"miles.blair@accenture.com","name":"Blair"},"message":"feat: gateway-centric personalisation system with Klaviyo integration\n\nPhase 1 - Data layer:\n  db/migrations/001_personalisation.sql: 7 tables (sessions, customers,\n  fit_profiles, preference_profiles, session_signals, klaviyo_links,\n  recommendation_snapshots)\n  src/lib/db.ts: Postgres pool with MockDb fallback (no local PG needed)\n  src/lib/cache.ts: ICache interface, in-memory LRU + optional Redis\n\nPhase 2 - Klaviyo client:\n  src/integrations/klaviyo/KlaviyoClient.ts: Profiles, Events, Catalogs APIs\n  Exponential backoff + circuit breaker (5 failures/30s)\n  NoOpKlaviyoClient when KLAVIYO_PRIVATE_KEY not set\n\nPhase 3 - Consent state machine:\n  src/lib/consent.ts: essential / analytics / marketing states\n  src/app/api/gateway/consent/route.ts: GET/POST consent\n\nPhase 4 - PersonalizationService:\n  src/services/PersonalizationService.ts: two-path ranking (logged-in vs anon)\n  heroPicks, shopByStyleBundles, becauseYouLiked, trendingInYourFit output\n  Snapshot persistence (30min anon, 4hr auth TTL)\n  Swipe result application + session signal recording\n\nPhase 5 - Gateway endpoints:\n  /api/context: CustomerContext <200ms P95 (cached)\n  /api/recommendations: ranked products + bundles <300ms P95\n  /api/gateway/session/signals: POST session signals\n  /api/gateway/klaviyo/event: POST consent-gated events\n  /api/gateway/privacy/delete + /export: data privacy stubs\n\nPhase 6 - Frontend:\n  src/features/personalisation/FitSelector.tsx: logged-out fit widget\n  src/features/personalisation/StyleBundles.tsx: gateway-driven recs\n\nPhase 7 - Tests:\n  tests/unit/personalization.test.ts: 11 Vitest unit tests (all pass)\n  vitest.config.ts: unit test config\n  tests/ui.spec.ts: +5 Playwright personalisation smoke tests\n\nPhase 8 - Docs:\n  PERSONALIZATION_ARCHITECTURE.md: data residency, consent, swap guides\n\nVerification: typecheck pass (0 errors), 11/11 unit tests, build pass (25 routes)","tree":{"sha":"dd4a5f2759750d4bb877326f9c0681a30ceeb410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/trees/dd4a5f2759750d4bb877326f9c0681a30ceeb410"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milesjblair-max/kingsize-web/git/commits/849d697bd12d995aa102ca16edd4