:"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mikkie67","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mikkie67/PropulsionV2p0/commits/66c9ba768394ae4a291a84d5af91872c2e67e358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-08T11:31:52Z","email":"ivor.kruger@gmail.com","name":"Ivor Kruger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-08T11:31:52Z","email":"ivor.kruger@gmail.com","name":"Ivor Kruger"},"message":"Fix temperature display and display refresh\n\n- Changed temperature struct fields (MotorTemp, ControllerTemp, BatteryTemp,\n  AmbientTemp, CoolantTemp, ShaftRpm) from uint32_t to int32_t to properly\n  handle -1 sentinel values for uninitialized displays\n\n- Fixed display refresh lambda in setupLcdDisplay() to capture sDisplayData\n  by reference [&] instead of by value [] for real-time updates\n\n- Temperature display now correctly shows \"--C\" for uninitialized values and\n  \"XYC\" format for actual readings\n\n- Verified coolant fan (303.15K/305.15K) and ambient fan (308.15K/310.15K)\n  hysteresis controls functioning properly\n\n- Added debug output to monitor display updates","tree":{"sha":"4ab97a691c7278fe41ee64480c0b38f4adfeedd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mikkie67/PropulsionV2p0/git/trees/4ab97a691c7278fe41ee64480c0b38f4adfeedd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mikkie67/PropulsionV2p0/git/commits/66c9ba768394ae4a291a84d5af91872c2e67e358","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12305382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mikkie67/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mikkie67/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mikkie67/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mikkie67/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mikkie67","id":12305382,"login":"Mikkie67","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE